SUMMARY:Brown County Christkindl Market
DESCRIPTION:Nestled in Coachlight Square, the 6th Annual Christkindl market will bring to Brown County a traditional European holiday market full of one-of-a-kind gifts, family friendly entertainment and Christmas spirit.\nFestively decorated booths, live music, Santa and Mrs. Claus, and a traditional Chirstkindl Market Angel, along with participation from local businesses, restaurants, artists and performers are sure to bring holiday cheer for all to enjoy.\n
