SUMMARY:Island Pampered Princess Party
DESCRIPTION:It’s time for our second annual Island Pampered Princess Party!! Our first party date of the summer is almost full, and we can’t wait to welcome your island princesses!\n\nDesigned for ages 2–10, this sweet experience was thoughtfully planned with pampering, creativity, and magical memories in mind\n\nEach princess in attendance will receive:\n🌺 Flower lei upon arrival\n✨ Pendent necklace with her choice of a Moana-inspired design— she’ll  watch her pendent be custom engraved before her eyes! Necklaces will include a clasp.\n🏝️ Wayfinder Wish Bottle experience with colorful sand and island treasures 🐚\n🌈 Nails painted with non-toxic polish\n🌸 Hair decorated with a flower clip, hair gems, and glitter mist\n💖One themed glitter tattoo or a bead of hair tinsel ($6 upgrade to enjoy both!)\n🍪 Cookie, juice, and themed goodie bag\n\nThese are some of our favorite events to host 🥹 Whether you’re planning a special mommy-and-me outing, a day date with Grandma, or looking for a fun activity during your Brown County getaway, this is such a magical way to make summer memories together.\n\nThese parties will be hosted in our new cottage space right next door to the cabin!\n\nReserve your spot now at BrownCountyCharm.com. Once your booking is received, we’ll send a confirmation and deposit invoice within 48 hours.\n\n🪩 June 27 • July 11 • July 18\n🌺 $50 per princess\n🌊 75 S Jefferson Street, Nashville, Indiana in Antique Alley\n
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/island-pampered-princess-party/
