SUMMARY:Martina McBride
DESCRIPTION:Multiple Grammy® nominee Martina McBride  ( http://martinamcbride.com/ )has sold over 23 million albums to date, which includes 20 Top 10 singles and six No. 1 hits.\nMartina McBride  ( http://martinamcbride.com/ )has earned more than 15 major music awards, including four wins for Female Vocalist of the Year from the Country Music Association and won three Academy of Country Music for Top Female Vocalist. Martina has been awarded 14 Gold Records, nine Platinum honors, three Double Platinum Records, and two Triple Platinum Awards. Martina was awarded the Covenant House Beacon of Hope Award and Music Business Association’s prestigious 2015 Harry Chapin Memorial Humanitarian Award for her philanthropic efforts on behalf of domestic violence. In 2019 Martina received the Cliffie Stone Icon Award at the ACM Honors event for her impactful contributions to Country Music. Martina was honored during the 46th Annual Common Wealth Awards of Distinguished Service for her philanthropic work and contributions to society. In 2021 Martina unveiled her first exhibit in the Country Music Hall of Fame and Museum, titled “The Power of Her Voice.”\nMartina has released two cookbooks – the first, Around the Table, a full-color illustrated collection of her favorite recipes, hosting tips, practical menu planning advice, and themed décor inspiration. She released her second book, Martina’s Kitchen Mix: My Recipe Playlist for Real Life, in October 2018. Most recently Martina launched her own wine label, Luna & Finn, named after her beloved pets.\nWhen Martina isn’t in the studio, she focuses her time on charitable causes dear to her heart through her Team Music Is Love charity imitative.\nMcBride resides in Nashville with her husband, John, and their three daughters. You can keep up with her on Facebook ( http://tumblr.us12.list-manage1.com/track/click?u=12625cf9000644aef0f718377&id=1c27fb98dd&e=a1574695d1 ), as well as Twitter ( http://tumblr.us12.list-manage.com/track/click?u=12625cf9000644aef0f718377&id=5297e24a37&e=a1574695d1 ) and Instagram ( http://tumblr.us12.list-manage.com/track/click?u=12625cf9000644aef0f718377&id=cee3019f2d&e=a1574695d1 ). For tour dates, please visit her website ( http://www.martinamcbride.com/tour ).\n
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/martina-mcbride/
CATEGORIES:Entertainment,Happening,Live Music
LOCATION:200 Maple Leaf Boulevard, Nashville, IN 47448
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncounty.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/957EE081-4463-462F-B078-5209E0EA6AA7-copy-3-13.jpg
END:VEVENT
