SUMMARY:Brown County Sports & TCG Expo
DESCRIPTION:Buy, sell, and trade your favorite collectables at the Brown County Card Show! Featuring sports cards, Pokémon cards, Yu-Gi-Oh!, Lorcana, Magic: The Gathering, One Piece and more! This event will bring together collectors, vendors, and fans from across the region. Browes both vintage and modern cards, meet fellow enthusiasts, and enjoy a fun community atmosphere at Mike’s Dance Barn in Brown County, IN. Whether you’re a seasoned collector or just getting started, there’s something here for everyone!\n
